// # Kubernetes, Cloud Native & Distributed Systems Facade
//
// Logline: Unified standard library facade re-exporting Consensus, CRDTs, Traffic Control, Kubernetes Models, and Observability.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim importing all 49 companion submodules and exposing top-level system entry points.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import consensus, replication, membership, time, CRDT, traffic, and K8s submodules.
//   2. Re-export typed public constructors and execution facade helpers.
//   3. Maintain unified standard library entry point for cloud_k8s subsystem.

